<http://data.silknow.org/object/76a81299-8e0c-3cb1-9a8c-73685b1f9219>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Central medallion of guilloche bands and a repeating floral motif, bearing an applied coat-of-arms(three lions rampant) backed by stylized acanthus leaves and surmounted by a crown. On either side a horizontal, symmetrical floral spray with inwardly curling leafy branches and leaves plus wheat stalks. All within a similar rectangular guilloche border. Outer border, a straight stalk with stylized leaves and blossoms within scalloped bands. Metal strips and coils, metallic yarns, sequins and spangles plus polychrome velvet and floss silk yarns on a red gold-shot ribbed silk ground. Metallic tape edging and metallic bottom fringe probably later additions. Ground worn, some missing yarns."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/61814e24-2cf9-3fa5-87e1-180527194e7f> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Central medallion of guilloche bands and a repeating floral motif, bearing an applied coat-of-arms(three lions rampant) backed by stylized acanthus leaves and surmounted by a crown. On either side a horizontal, symmetrical floral spray with inwardly curling leafy branches and leaves plus wheat stalks. All within a similar rectangular guilloche border. Outer border, a straight stalk with stylized leaves and blossoms within scalloped bands. Metal strips and coils, metallic yarns, sequins and spangles plus polychrome velvet and floss silk yarns on a red gold-shot ribbed silk ground. Metallic tape edging and metallic bottom fringe probably later additions. Ground worn, some missing yarns."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/76a81299-8e0c-3cb1-9a8c-73685b1f9219/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/76a81299-8e0c-3cb1-9a8c-73685b1f9219/dimension/1> ;
